@startuml
|Secretary / Coordinator|
start
:Select report type;
:Link to student;
if (Thank You?) then (Yes)
  :Link to contribution;
endif
:Write narrative;
:Submit for review;

|Director|
if (Approve?) then (Approve)
  :Sign off;
else (Return)
  :Add return reason;
  |Secretary / Coordinator|
  :Revise narrative;
endif

|System|
:Generate PDF;
:Create communication record;
:Send to sponsor;

|Sponsor|
:Receive & read;
:Mark read_at;
stop
@enduml
